      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it\u0027s hard to estimate. You can estimate percent of blank lines in code and calculate how much bigger dom tree you get. This script I used in past to calculate dom subtree size if you are interested - https://paste.googleplex.com/5462465376944128\n\nBut I think it\u0027s better to compare diff metrics before and after this change\nhttps://cs.opensource.google/gerrit/gerrit/gerrit/+/master:polygerrit-ui/app/constants/reporting.ts;l\u003d71?q\u003dreporting\u0026ss\u003dgerrit\n\nWe fire these events that you can listen to https://cs.opensource.google/gerrit/gerrit/gerrit/+/master:polygerrit-ui/app/embed/diff/gr-diff/gr-diff-element.ts;l\u003d174?q\u003dfireRenderContent\u0026sq\u003d\u0026ss\u003dgerrit\nin any gr-diff caller and measure performance.\n\nWe have SLO only for diff page load where we might get issues on huge files like in https://b.corp.google.com/issues/265943093",
